----------------------------------------------------------------------------
Why AGPL-3.0-only
----------------------------------------------------------------------------
MEYA's end-to-end encryption is built on Signal's libsignal and the
SparsePostQuantumRatchet library, both licensed under AGPL-3.0-only. MEYA's
Rust core (native/meya_crypto) links them, so MEYA as a whole is distributed
under the same licence. Anyone who receives MEYA, including through the
Android builds published under Releases, may obtain the corresponding source
code from this repository at the tag of that version.

